WHATNOW

What tamlinux-tools is doing now and what comes next. Read this first;
revise it at the end of every session (work/README-work).

Updated: 2026-11-17, with W1


STATE

  Standalone Tamlinux utilities in C on libtam, each with its own
  version. Branch develop, pushed.

  - tam-bundle 0.14.0 (src/tam-bundle/, TB_VERSION in tb.h): installs a
    Tamlinux assembly as a bundle with prepare and apply, format-2
    transactions, settings capture, dormant-slot migration and
    detachment, and, newest, optional host documentation with its own
    transactional selection (docs/plans/tam-bundle.md, "Optional host
    documentation (0.14.0)"). It is source-tested against libtam 0.7.1;
    package integration and physical acceptance are separate stages.
  - tam-journal 0.1.0 (src/tam-journal.c): daily plain-text journal
    files (docs/plans/plain-text-journal.md).
  - tam-file-select (src/tam-file-select.c): file chooser through the
    desktop portal (libtam-portal).

  The history of every change is in work/history/; the newest is the
  0.6.28 work (2026-11-16).


