WATCH OUT

  - Tools reach the workstation only through a recorded
    tamlinux-packages assembly, never from this checkout.
  - Every code change bumps that tool's version in the same commit.
  - make test runs the bundle, busy and journal suites; the bundle
    suites use private namespaces and temporary roots and never touch
    the installed system.
  - Development installs use PREFIX=$HOME/.local, never /usr/local.
